# Pilot Validation Mode (pilot-v1)

**Status:** FROZEN at tag `pilot-v1`. P0 workflow hardening is accepted.

## Forbidden

- No new features or menu expansion
- No architecture refactors
- No AI features
- No cloud sync work
- No workflow redesign unless pilot users repeatedly fail the same step

## Allowed

- Crash fixes
- Data-loss fixes
- Pilot feedback fixes (from real user sessions)
- Small UX polish (labels, clarity, confusion points)
- Client language corrections

## Client language

**Say:** INT Zone Studio · Pilot Evaluation Build v1

**Never say:** Production Release, Commercial Release, Enterprise Edition

## Supported workflow (only)

Import Drawing → Automatic Detection → Review → Recovery → Save Project → Reopen Project → Export Package

## Pilot size

- **Round 1:** 3–5 drawings, 1–2 engineers
- **Round 2 (if pass):** 10–20 drawings, multiple users

## Primary validation signal

Suspected Gaps → engineer clicks gap → Recover → useful?

Success quote: *"Gap list ne mujhe directly missing cell tak pahucha diya"*

## Metrics to collect

Detection count, suspected gap count, gap recoveries performed, Save/Open success, export package usage, user confusion points.

Do not optimize detection accuracy in isolation — optimize gap-to-recovery usefulness for real engineers.
